  POST /__slots?keys=a,b[&busy=b]   the live sessions (F3), and which are busy
  POST /__upload-limit?bytes=N the upload limit (default 50 MB)
  POST /__csrf-deny?on=1       refuse POST /api/chat and /api/upload/file as
